{"hymn":"FR165","parent":"E866","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Exerce ton esprit","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":["E","i"],"n2":["xerce","t"],"n3":"ton","n4":["es","i"],"n5":["prit!","t"],"n6":"Tes","n7":["pen","i"],"n8":["sé","m"],"n9":["es","t"],"n10":["re","i"],"n11":["jette.","t"],"n12":"Aux","n13":"saints,","n14":["tou","i"],"n15":["jours","t"],"n16":["u","i"],"n17":["nis,","t"],"n18":"Le","n19":"Corps","n20":"tu","n21":["res","i"],"n22":["pectes.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Exerce ton esprit !","Toute forme oublie.","Partage avec les saints,","Jouis de ton Christ."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Exerce ton esprit !","À ton moi renonce.","Servant avec les saints,","Ton Seigneur annonce."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Exerce ton esprit,","Ton ame renie.","Prends bien soin des autres,","Prends Christ comme appui."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Libéré en esprit,","De tes propres lois,","Ne te condamne pas,","Mais sois à la croix."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Libéré en esprit,","Du moi obstiné","Et de la vaine gloire, Pour tout surmonter."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["Exerce ton esprit,","Sois donc victorieux,","Par le sang qui lave, Par Son nom glorieux."]},{"label":"8.","lines":["Exerce ton esprit,","Saisis le Seigneur,","Prends la Parole en toi, Touchant ton esprit."]},{"label":"9.","lines":["Ton esprit te permet,","De Le proclamer.","Ton esprit te permet, D'être satisfait."]},{"label":"10.","lines":["Exerce ton esprit,","C'est ton seul besoin,","Exerce ton esprit, Et tout ira bien."]}]}